WEBVTT

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:43.510
In ancient times, when the ancestor of the Queen descended from Ephon Noha to Tahai Aze,

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:48.550
the people met the Founding King, Je, who was tall and had golden eyes.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:52.310
It was the holy God Himself.

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:58.030
So many thousands of days and nights later,

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.110
Queen
So many thousands of days and nights later,

00:01:59.110 --> 00:01:59.510
Queen

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:03.040
since the capital governed by the Queen does not have an army,
Queen

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:03.280
since the capital governed by the Queen does not have an army,

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.600
it is now currently protected by the Grand Duke,

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.040
who possesses an army specializing in Touda, and technically governs the quarters on the other side of the mountains.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.410
Grand Duke
who possesses an army specializing in Touda, and technically governs the quarters on the other side of the mountains.

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:12.970
Grand Duke

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:20.200
The Grand Duke's lionhearted soldiers fight the invasion from the neighboring country by using the strength of the Touda.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:30.550
The Touda used by the Grand Duke's army are raised in Ake Village, away from the capital and the battlefield.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:38.240
Ake Village

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:52.030
Erin, who lives in the village, wishes to become a great Touda doctor and she helps her mother, who is a beastinarian, every day.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:58.660
In Ake Village, egg hunting happens once a year.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:06.100
Beginning in the morning, all the children and adults start working diligently on the preparations.

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:17.090
Erin and the Egg Thieves

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:21.560
Please feed enough extra food to provide for tomorrow's portion, too.

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.420
But make sure you don't supply too much.

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:25.560
All right.

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:42.890
Lulu, is it better now?

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.430
Did it forget me?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.240
Erin.

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:54.980
What happened to the benetrophic water?

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:58.030
I asked you to bring some, didn't I?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.630
Ah, I'm sorry!  I'll get some right now!

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.230
Done!

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.940
Ah, just like you.

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.110
What's that?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.440
Can't you tell?  It's my face.

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:27.370
You're such a child.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.210
What?  You're a child yourself.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:37.430
Too bad for you, but I'll be going egg hunting with Dad tomorrow.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.890
But you were afraid of Touda.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.320
These are two different matters.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.000
Going egg hunting is a sign that you're an adult.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:53.300
I'll be seen as a grownup from now on.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:56.360
I'm not interested in egg hunting.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.980
I'm glad I'm still a child.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.800
You place the egg in this?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:15.150
That's right.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:21.170
The moss absorbs water and provides adequate moisture for the egg.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:24.790
But why do we have to go to the swamp?

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:27.810
Why not have a Touda in our ponds lay an egg?

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:34.270
It's a tradition to go get our own eggs from the swamp.

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.900
Hey, Mom.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:43.470
Babies that hatch will have their ear-webs cut like Lulu, right?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:45.690
So that they can hear the mute whistle?

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:52.620
Yes.  It's a necessity in order for the Touda riders to control them.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:04.890
I don't want that!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.310
I'm sorry.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:18.310
If you can't concentrate, then you should probably go back to taking care of goats starting tomorrow.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.700
Beastinarians handle the beasts' lives.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:34.150
The more you learn about Touda, the more you'll probably suffer from that torment.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:40.080
Do you still want to do this job?

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:48.480
Then you should watch the egg hunt once with your own eyes.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.640
The egg hunt?

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:13.180
What, you're coming, too?

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:13.990
Yup.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.010
Let us depart!

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.930
Yeah!

00:07:54.720 --> 00:08:01.380
Men march through the dark forest toward the Lagoe Swamp.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:07.820
Dad, wild Touda are a lot smaller than those in the ponds, right?

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:11.350
I'll beat one up if it attacks us.

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:16.310
Wild Touda won't assault us without reason.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:20.760
If you run into one, stare into its eyes and slowly back away.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.140
Hurry up, Mokku.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:29.530
We need to get out of this forest before the sun rises.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:32.930
Nukku-ani...  I can't walk any farther.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:34.630
Quit your whining.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:37.420
I'm hungry just like you.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:41.830
Man...  I wish I had some large shishi meat before me right now.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.710
"Shishi meat?!"

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.510
Itadakimasu!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.740
W-What do you think you're doing?

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:56.640
Let go!

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.600
Hey, you idiot!  Someone's coming.  Hide.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:08.540
Where are they going, all equipped, at this late hour?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.950
I know.  They must be hunting for shishi.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.760
Who'd hunt for shishi with so many people?

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:16.040
Hide!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:31.630
Ah, I get it.  They must be out Touda egg hunting.

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:33.840
"Touda egg hunting?"

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.460
What's that?

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:40.440
Take a Touda egg to the capital, and you'll get three large gold nuggets.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.980
"Three large gold nuggets?!"

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:46.400
Yay!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.510
We might be able to make a quick buck here.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:13.960
Mom, why is egg hunting done before dawn?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:17.930
Because that's the time when Touda are the slowest.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:23.120
Wild Touda still have their ear-webs so the mute whistle is ineffective against them, right?

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:24.410
Yeah.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.700
What's this sound?

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.250
It's the voice of a Touda calling for other Touda.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.900
A Touda's voice?

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:39.830
On occasion, partnered Touda call for each other like this.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:46.820
Touda are feared because they're so terrifying, but in
actuality they have a caring heart for their own.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.370
Really?

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.100
Here's some!  I found them!

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:13.070
It's been too long since they were laid. There are splotches coming up.

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.990
It'll die if we take it back now.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.020
Dang.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:20.230
There's nothing we can do.  Let's search for more.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.360
This is what a Touda egg looks like?

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:27.640
They're beautiful.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.830
I can't find any, Ani.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.180
Quit your whining.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:36.110
Search harder for them.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:37.580
Okay.

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.780
My foot's caught.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:46.180
God...  What are you doing?

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.680
You can't get yours out, either?

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:55.360
S-Shut up!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.280
What's that?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.000
I-It's a Touda!

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:22.300
The sun's about to rise.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:26.270
Let's hurry.  At this rate, we'll have to return empty-handed.

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:29.230
Another empty nest.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.870
Could it have already hatched?

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:37.190
No.  It's too early for any eggs in Lagoe to hatch.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.630
Still no luck?

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:41.750
We're sorry.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:49.260
Help!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.020
Maybe the eggs were stolen.

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.310
Who would do such a thing?

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:03.970
I'm sure I heard the voice from this direction.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.170
What are you two doing?

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.770
Little girl, there!  Please!  Help!

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.660
A Touda!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:26.090
At this rate, we'll be eaten!

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.410
Hold on a moment.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.670
Faster!  Faster!

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:33.580
Faster!  Faster!
Faster!  Faster!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.080
Faster!  Faster!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:41.640
Ani!

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:46.210
Oji-san!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.540
Grab this branch.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.500
You saved us.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.540
Little girl!

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:12.160
What do we do, Ani?

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.440
She'll be eaten.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:16.550
Well...

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:18.810
Mokku, you go save her.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.650
No, you go save her.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:34.140
It's fine.  Wild Touda don't assault without reason.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.200
Stare into its eyes and slowly back away.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.220
That belly...

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.170
Erin.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.690
Mom.

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:24.190
A really fat Touda just went into that cave.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.150
Its belly was really big.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.110
A Touda with a big belly?

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:34.440
It might be a Touda with eggs.

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:38.370
You wait right here.

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:39.830
Okay.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:58.190
What are you looking at?

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:03.300
A Touda with eggs might be in there.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.190
Really?

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.410
Then I'll go get everyone.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.200
"Eggs?"

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.890
Ani!

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:45.690
Is this the cave where the Touda with the eggs is?

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:49.330
Um, Mom told me to wait here.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.700
I can't leave the matter in that woman's hands.

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.220
Mokku.  You go first.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.530
Don't wanna.  You go first.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:19.870
You will get to eat a mountain of shishi meat, and all you can eat, too!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.550
Then you come with me.

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:34.400
There are the eggs.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.340
Freshly laid, too.

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:38.110
Wadan-san, we need to hurry.

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.800
Shut up, I know.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:51.860
Watch out!

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.030
Run away!

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.540
Stop it!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:18.650
Now!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.040
Grab its horns!

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.950
Don't scare us like that.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:46.990
Come on.  Hurry and get the eggs.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.000
Yes.

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:56.050
Erin.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:01.390
Please!  Don't take these eggs.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:04.850
They're eggs that she worked so hard at laying.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:08.730
If they live here, they won't have to be used in the war.

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:12.600
Please.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:15.150
Please let them be.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:18.550
Erin.  Step aside.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:19.450
No.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:23.210
Don't be difficult.

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:30.290
You know very well how we have to obey our code and live with the Touda.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.260
But...

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:37.380
Beastinarians don't exist for the sake of the beasts.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:42.260
We exist for the sake of the people who live with the beasts.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.650
H-Hey!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.690
Why don't you listen a little to what she says!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.910
I feel sorry for its mom, too!

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:57.900
Oji-san.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:20:59.680
Who are you guys?

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.170
You must be the egg thieves.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.810
You must be the fellows behind all the empty nests.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.060
Wait.  We didn't do anything.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:13.430
Yeah!  We were trying to get the eggs, but we haven't gotten any yet!

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:15.000
You idiot!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.190
So you guys are egg thieves!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.110
Catch them!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.620
To interrupt the egg hunt...  Honestly.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.110
Like mother, like daughter.

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:34.770
I'm sorry, Wadan-san.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:37.610
I'll thoroughly lecture her later.

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:47.780
Mom...

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:58.420
Erin learned how naïve she still is.

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:06.360
At the same time, she was repentant for the fact that she had caused trouble for her mother.

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:12.220
"Codes are meant to be followed."

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:22.390
Even while she understood that, Erin wished, in her heart, to one day live in harmony with the beasts.

00:24:01.990 --> 00:24:06.760
Erin and Soyon are the family of
my deceased son, Asson.

00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:12.110
They've lived a peaceful life, following the
code of the Touda breeders.

00:24:12.110 --> 00:24:20.830
However, Soyon's fate becomes influenced by the code
when the Touda's funeral cry echoes through the air.

00:24:20.830 --> 00:24:25.030
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Soyon's Warmth.

00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:25.050
Soyon's Warmth
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Soyon's Warmth.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:30.030
Soyon's Warmth
